    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Establishing a solar power plant in the company&rsquo;s site in Turaif with a generation capacity of 22 megawatts (MW), reducing carbon emissions by 1.5 million tons.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
